{"id":1317,"date":"2026-08-22T16:41:40","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T16:41:40","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1317"},"modified":"2026-08-22T19:48:25","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T19:48:25","slug":"page-size-format","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/page-size-format\/","title":{"rendered":"Page Size &#038; Format"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Size &amp; Format<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher supports a comprehensive range of international page sizes. You can change your canvas size at any time from the <strong>Page Design<\/strong> ribbon using the <strong>Size<\/strong> button.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Available Page Sizes<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1324\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/a4v2t1.jpg\" alt=\"Available Page Sizes\" width=\"339\" height=\"256\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/a4v2t1.jpg 592w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/a4v2t1-300x227.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 339px) 100vw, 339px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>A3 &#8211;<\/strong> 297 \u00d7 420mm<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>A4 &#8211;<\/strong> 210 \u00d7 297mm (European \/ UK default)<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>A5 &#8211;<\/strong> 148 \u00d7 210mm<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Letter &#8211;<\/strong> 8.5 \u00d7 11\u201d (US \/ Canada \/ Mexico default)<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Legal &#8211;<\/strong> 8.5 \u00d7 14\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Tabloid &#8211;<\/strong> 11 \u00d7 17\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Business Card &#8211;<\/strong> 3.5 \u00d7 2\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">Each preset is represented by a unique icon in the dropdown and the top-right corner of the canvas always displays the correct format indicator.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Locale-Aware Defaults<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1326\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LocaleAwareDefaults.webp\" alt=\"Locale-Aware Defaults\" width=\"178\" height=\"186\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LocaleAwareDefaults.webp 930w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LocaleAwareDefaults-287x300.webp 287w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LocaleAwareDefaults-768x804.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 178px) 100vw, 178px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">When you create a new document, Open Publisher automatically selects the correct default page size for your region. Users in the US, Canada, Mexico, Colombia, Venezuela, Chile, and the Philippines default to <strong>US Letter<\/strong>; users everywhere else default to <strong>A4<\/strong>. This happens automatically in the background without any setup required.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Format Indicator<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The page format indicator in the top-right corner of the canvas always reflects your current format precisely. It is wired directly into the rendering engine and updates instantly whenever you change size, switch pages, undo, or redo.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-413 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727.jpeg\" alt=\"Page Format Indicator\" width=\"2393\" height=\"448\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727.jpeg 2393w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-300x56.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-1024x192.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-768x144.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-1536x288.jpeg 1536w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-2048x383.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2393px) 100vw, 2393px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Page Size &amp; Format Open Publisher supports a comprehensive range of international page sizes. You can change your canvas size at any time from the Page Design ribbon using the Size button. Available Page Sizes A3 &#8211; 297 \u00d7 420mm A4 &#8211; 210 \u00d7 297mm (European \/ UK default) A5 &#8211; 148 \u00d7 210mm Letter [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1328,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-1317","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1317","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1317"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1317\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1331,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1317\/revisions\/1331"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1328"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1317"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1317"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}